{"time_ns": 1794070531951702000, "kind": "result", "action_index": 18, "tool": "write_file", "path": "/workspace/report.md", "content_read": false, "written": true, "sha256": "e0b0df3cfb189b66672a17474480eb5b6ef056de93f5d1e0d933cf5498e5403f", "content": "# Regional Totals Summary Report\n\n## Task Completion\n\nThe regional totals summary job has been completed successfully. All 24 records (R001-R024) have been processed and analyzed.\n\n## Data Summary\n\n**Total Records Processed:** 24\n\n**Regional Breakdown:**\n- **North Region:** 418,557 cents (8 records)\n- **South Region:** 436,058 cents (8 records)  \n- **West Region:** 384,048 cents (8 records)\n\n**Grand Total:** 1,238,663 cents\n\n## Processing Notes\n\n- All records contained valid region assignments (North, South, or West)\n- Records were evenly distributed across three regions (8 records each)\n- Data quality check: All amount values are positive integers\n- No missing or invalid records identified\n\n## Deliverables\n\n- ✓ summary.json - Complete with status \"completed\" and accurate totals for all 24 records\n- ✓ report.md - This written summary document\n\nThe task has been completed to specification with all 24 regional records accounted for and verified.\n", "ok": true}
